# Facts of the consecutive-write pace guard (middleware_guards.transition).
# changesSceneState = is_write(cmd, args) AND cmd NOT IN SCENE_STATE_NEUTRAL_WRITES AND NOT (cmd=="batch" AND batch_readonly).
# consecutiveWrites is the counter value AFTER the host increments it (or 0 if this call resets it).
CONTRACT unitymcp.writepace
COVERAGE declared-scope
MODULE writepace_facts
FACT pace.changesSceneState bool
FACT pace.consecutiveWrites number min=0 max=1000000 integer
INPUT writePace pace.changesSceneState pace.consecutiveWrites
